    "evidence": [
      "source view_01 is the diameter-196 gear end; the reference STEP bounds are 196 by 196 in raw XY and 141 along raw Z",
      "source A-A places the 53 mm internal-gear region at screen left and the remaining axial steps toward screen right, matching raw Z increasing from the authored gear face",
      "v1 model.py constructs the internal gear and eight blind M8 holes from raw z=0, so the detailed source end is the raw -Z observation side"
    ],
    "ambiguities": [
      "The 40 teeth and eight-hole pitch circle do not distinguish an in-plane half-turn or reflection-equivalent X sign; right=-X is a deterministic representative that keeps up=+Y and camera=-Z",
      "The radial M12 port helps the axial section but is not sufficiently visible in the external end crop to remove all roll ambiguity"
    ],
